- `bash --version` → 3.2.57(1)-release (arm64-apple-darwin25)
- `bash test/ctl-fleet-tasks.sh` → reproduced: PASS A4; FAIL A5, A1a-c, A2, A3
- Direct dump with fixture store → exit 0, TASKS block rendered
- `bash -x` trace → `++ CAPTURE_DUMP_RC=0` set in subshell; parent reads rc=1
- awk extraction test → 1 line (signature only)
- bin/ctl-fleet:380-381 → loadTasksStore() is first statement of refreshSlow

